ehlên me didin... bixwin.
 
Have you boiled it yourself, no, we just give it to friends
and partners and our family... to eat.

231
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:19,000
Ev bi destê xwe tê kelandin...
 
Is this boiled by hand...

232
00:20:19,000 --> 00:20:23,000
Em weha şîn dikin û didin.
 
We grow them like this and give them out.

233
