Aaa eceb weke dîyar e weha... Ev bi çend cureyan tê firotin
weha...
 
Ah it's strangely visible like this... This is sold in a few
types like this...

234
00:20:27,000 --> 00:20:30,000
Pêşî me weha da, dû re em dîsa weha didinê.
 
First we gave it like this, then we give it again like this.

235
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:34,000
Ji xeynî vê em bîberê jî dibînin, bîberên hişk jî li kû ne?
 
Besides this we also see pepper, where are the dried
peppers?

236
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:39,000
Ev bîberên hişk in, em didin. Bîbera sor e.
 
These are the dried peppers, we give them. It's red pepper.

237
00:20:39,000 --> 00:20:43,000
Xwedê ji te razî be. Xwedê karê te hêsan bike, malava.
 
May God be pleased with you. May God make your work easy,
thank you.

238
00:20:43,000 --> 00:20:49,000
Ser çavan. Hûn her hebî. Xwedê ji we razî be. Înşellah ev
karê we her tim dewam be.
 
You're welcome. May you live long. May God be pleased with
you. Hopefully your work will always continue.

239
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:54,000
Ser çavan, em bi rastî kêfxweş bûn ku em hatin ba te, em ê
derbasî cem hin dî bibin. Em karê xwe xelas bikin.
 
You're welcome, we were honestly very happy to come to you,
we will move on to someone else. Let's finish our work.

240
00:20:54,000 --> 00:20:59,000
Ser çavan. Em kêfxweş bûn. Bixêr hatin.
 
You're welcome. We were happy. Welcome.

241
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:03,000
Te ev pênc difirotin? Kîlo bi pênc firotin ne wisa? Ev bîber
