242
00:21:03,000 --> 00:21:07,000
Kîlo pêncî me firotin erê.
 
Yes, we sold a kilo for fifty.

243
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:08,000
Di meha şeşan de?
 
In the sixth month?

244
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:10,000
Elhemdullah şikir.
 
Thank God, thanks.

245
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:14,000
Xwedê te razî be, ser çavan.
 
God bless you, you're welcome.

246
