Destmala kê çardor rêşî?
 
Whose handkerchief has a fringed border?

259
00:22:17,000 --> 00:22:20,000
Lê Sîno, lê Sînê min...
 
Oh Sino, oh my Sine...

260
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:21,000
Merheba kake.
 
Hello brother.

261
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:23,000
Ehlen û sehlen kake.
 
Welcome brother.

262
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:24,000
Em te nas bikin.
 
Let's get to know you.

263
00:22:24,000 --> 00:22:30,000
Em li vira ne li navçeya Şiyê, em makîneyên dîrektoran û
çerxên dîrektoran çêdikin, meşhûr e.
 
We are here in the Shiye district, we repair tractors and
