Do you have a word you want to add?

389
00:32:46,000 --> 00:32:50,000
Bi Xwedê a me ya girîng ev e, tesdîr vebe. Zeytê me si'rê wê
baş be.
 
By God, our important thing is this, for exports to open up.
For the price of our olive oil to be good.

390
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:51,000
