I send this to brother Nazmi, father of Bangin. May it bring
joy to your hearts, come on, come on, come on.

493
00:44:56,000 --> 00:45:01,000
Çûm Çûme Efrînê canê, hatim Efrînê canê
 
I went, I went to Afrin dear, I came to Afrin dear.

494
00:45:01,000 --> 00:45:17,000
Çûm Çûme Efrînê canê, hatim Efrînê canê
 
I went, I went to Afrin dear, I came to Afrin dear.

495
00:45:17,000 --> 00:45:22,000
Min anî hinarê barik, min anî hinarê barik
 
I brought fine pomegranates, I brought fine pomegranates.

496
00:45:22,000 --> 00:45:38,000
Bûk li zêva me mibarek, bûk li zêva me mibarek
 
The bride is blessed in our celebration, the bride is
blessed in our celebration.

497
00:45:38,000 --> 00:45:44,000
Çûme deşt û çiyan, can û delala min nediya
 
I went to plains and mountains, I didn't see my beautiful
soulmate.

498
00:45:44,000 --> 00:46:00,000
Çûme deşt û çiyan, can û delala min nediya
 
I went to plains and mountains, I didn't see my beautiful
soulmate.

499
00:46:00,000 --> 00:46:05,000
Sorgulî di baxê neman, Sorgulî di baxê neman
 
Red roses are no longer in the garden, red roses are no
longer in the garden.

500
00:46:05,000 --> 00:46:21,000
Gulek hebû li gundê han, gulek hebû li gundê han
 
There was a rose in that village, there was a rose in that
village.

501
00:46:21,000 --> 00:46:27,000
Çûme Efrînê canê, hatim Efrînê canê
 
I went to Afrin dear, I came to Afrin dear.

502
00:46:27,000 --> 00:46:42,000
Çûm Çûme Efrînê canê, hatim Efrînê canê
 
I went, I went to Afrin dear, I came to Afrin dear.

503
00:46:42,000 --> 00:46:48,000
Min anî hinarê barik, min anî hinarê barik
 
I brought fine pomegranates, I brought fine pomegranates.

504
00:46:48,000 --> 00:47:06,000
Bûk li zêva me mibarek, bûk li zêva me mibarek
 
The bride is blessed in our celebration, the bride is
blessed in our celebration.

505
00:47:06,000 --> 00:47:10,000
Belê temaşevanên me yên hêja, spasiyên xwe arasteyî we
dikin.
 
Yes our dear viewers, we present our thanks to you.

506
00:47:10,000 --> 00:47:14,000
Em kêfxweş in ku em car din hatin ciyekî din, kaniyek din.
 
We are happy to have come once again to another place,
another spring.

507
00:47:14,000 --> 00:47:18,000
Ewilî min şaş kir, min digot qey kaniya fûar e.
 
At first I was mistaken, I thought it was a fountain spring.

508
00:47:18,000 --> 00:47:23,000
Înşallah rojek ji rojan, emê qesta kaniya fûarê jî bikin ku
li Efrînê ye.
 
Hopefully one day, we will visit the fountain spring located
in Afrin too.

509
00:47:23,000 --> 00:47:28,000
Lê wextê em ji gundan derdiketin, em li dor van kaniyan
geriyan û me ev kanî dît.
 
But when we were leaving the villages, we wandered around
these springs and saw this spring.

510
00:47:28,000 --> 00:47:32,000
Me berê jî xeber da, cihê ku kaniyên lê dertên qestel e.
 
As we mentioned before, the place where springs emerge is
called a 'qestel' (fountainhead).

511
00:47:32,000 --> 00:47:34,000
Qestela gundê Mistikan.
 
The fountainhead of Mistikan village.

512
00:47:34,000 --> 00:47:37,000
Silavê me ji gundê Mistikan û ji gundê Qestelê ra hene.
 
Our greetings go to Mistikan village and Qestel village.

513
00:47:37,000 --> 00:47:40,000
Û ji Qestel Cindo ra, û ji gundên me yên Efrînê hemûyî ra
hene.
 
And to Qestel Cindo, and to all our villages in Afrin.

514
00:47:40,000 --> 00:47:42,000
Ji Çiyayê Kurmênc, û Çiyayê Hawarê ra hene.
 
To Kurmênc Mountain and Hawar Mountain.

515
00:47:42,000 --> 00:47:44,000
Lê niha em li kêleka kaniyê rûniştine, maşallah.
 
But now we are sitting by the spring, mashallah.

516
00:47:44,000 --> 00:47:48,000
Hûn jî dibînin, tebîetek pir xweşik heye li dor kaniyê.
 
As you can see, there is very beautiful nature around the
spring.

517
00:47:48,000 --> 00:47:52,000
Der û dora wê xweş kirine, dar lê tunebûn, me got emê jî li
ser vê yekê xeber din.
 
They have beautified its surroundings, there used to be no
trees here, we thought we should talk about this.

518
00:47:52,000 --> 00:47:56,000
Dema em derbas dibûn, me yek dît û me pirsî, "kê wiha
kiriye?" Wî gote "em".
 
When we were passing by, we saw someone and asked, "who did
this?" He said, "we did."

519
00:47:56,000 --> 00:47:59,000
Me jî got, "Xwedê ji we razî be ku hûn wiha xweşik dikin û
bê xwedî nahêlin."
 
We said, "May God bless you for making it beautiful and not
leaving it abandoned."

520
00:47:59,000 --> 00:48:01,000
Belê, em pir keyfxweş in.
 
Yes, we are very happy.

521
00:48:01,000 --> 00:48:04,000
Çaxê em xweşiyekê dibînin, wek kaniyê, yan jî darên zeytûnê,
em dixwazin nîşanî we bidin.
 
Whenever we see something beautiful, like a spring, or olive
trees, we want to show it to you.

522
00:48:04,000 --> 00:48:07,000
Heta rojeke din, bernameyek din, yan ciyekî din.
 
Until another day, another program, or another place.

523
00:48:07,000 --> 00:48:12,000
Em xatir ji we dixwazin. Bimînin di xêr û xweşiyê da.
 
We bid you farewell. Stay in goodness and health.

